# R8 repackages classes into the unnamed package to compact the DEX (AGP 9.1+).
#
# Kotlin's multifile part classes (CollectionsKt__IterablesKt,
# CollectionsKt__MutableCollectionsJVMKt, ...) are package-private and inherit
# from each other. Repackaging only the subclass while its superclass stays in
# kotlin.collections makes the superclass inaccessible and the app crashes
# before the first frame:
#
#   IllegalAccessError: Class kotlin.collections.j extended by class tp is
#   inaccessible
#
# Keeping the parts in their original packages prevents the split. Shrinking
# and optimization stay enabled, so this costs practically nothing.
-keep,allowshrinking,allowoptimization class kotlin.**Kt__*
